Subject: [PATCH 18/18] :bug: Map host producer aliases through Vulkan

An opaque FD is an API handle whose POSIX layout is not portable. Import
a duplicate on the exact Vulkan device and map the allocation through the
driver, retaining its lifetime through alias retirement. Require coherent
memory for this host diagnostic, check every word, and retain the explicit
raw mmap negative probe and the separately qualified native provider.
